sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ClientApp as Client App
    participant AuthServer as Authorization Server
    participant IdentityProvider as Identity Provider
    participant ConsentService as Consent Service
    participant TokenStore as Token Store
    participant ResourceServer as Resource Server

    User->>ClientApp: click login
    ClientApp->>AuthServer: authorization request
    AuthServer->>IdentityProvider: redirect for authentication
    User->>IdentityProvider: submit credentials
    IdentityProvider-->>AuthServer: identity confirmed
    AuthServer->>ConsentService: request user consent
    User->>ConsentService: approve scopes
    ConsentService-->>AuthServer: consent granted
    AuthServer->>TokenStore: store authorization code
    AuthServer-->>ClientApp: authorization code
    ClientApp->>AuthServer: exchange code for token
    AuthServer->>TokenStore: validate code
    TokenStore-->>AuthServer: code valid
    AuthServer-->>ClientApp: access token
    ClientApp->>ResourceServer: request resource with token
    ResourceServer->>AuthServer: validate token
    AuthServer-->>ResourceServer: token valid
    ResourceServer-->>ClientApp: protected resource
